Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:16:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash commands so provider commands
 bypass normal chat prompts

Selected-agent messages that start with slash are routed through a provider command API instead of the regular prompt send path. Codex resumes the existing thread with the raw command stdin and records command output, including thread-id changes from commands that fork or replace a session.
